<title>USA: Bush Industries Q1 shr fully diluted $0.37.</title>
<headline>Bush Industries Q1 shr fully diluted $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>JAMESTOWN, N.Y. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 13 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>						 3/29/97	    3/29/96</p>
<p> Net sales			     $70,867,000	$65,033,000</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of sales			48,346,000	 44,725,000</p>
<p>General, selling and</p>
<p>     administrative		   13,124,000	 12,149,000</p>
<p>   Interest expense			735,000	    353,000</p>
<p>					    62,205,000	 57,227,000</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes	8,662,000	  7,806,000</p>
<p> Income taxes			    3,384,000	  3,005,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			    5,278,000	  4,801,000</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   Primary					 .37	     .35(a)</p>
<p>   Fully diluted				 .37	     .35(a)</p>
<p>Weighted shares outstanding</p>
<p>   Primary				14,342,723    13,610,600(a)</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			14,365,596    13,829,250(a)</p>
<p>(a) Restated for the three-for-two stock split effectuated in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend paid on June 28, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
